{title: Yo nací para quererte}
{artist: Cherry Navarro}
{year: 1966}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}

{define: A7 base-fret 1 frets 0 1 0 0}
{define: Dm base-fret 1 frets 2 2 1 0}
{define: Gm base-fret 1 frets 0 2 3 1}
{define: Bm base-fret 1 frets 4 2 2 2}
{define: Em base-fret 1 frets 0 4 0 2}
{define: D base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 0}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[A7]↓  | [Dm]·  · · · | [Gm]·  · · · | [Dm]·  · [A7]·  ·
[Dm]·  · · · | [A7]·  · · · | [Dm]·  · · · | [A7]·  · · ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
[Dm] Hoy te can[Bm]to vida mí[Em]a [A7]
[D] Con to[Bm]da sinceri[Em]dad porque [A7]te adoro en ver[D]dad
Y ja[Em]más te olvidarí[A7]a [A7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[D] Si me [Bm]quieres mi vi[Em]dita [A7]
[D] Para [Bm]yo siempre que[Em]rerte [A7]
[D] Con el [Bm]cariño más [Em]fuerte [A7]
[D] Que en el [Bm]mundo pueda ha[Em]ber tu amor[A7] quisiera te[D]ner
Yo na[Em]cí para querer[A7]te [A7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verso 2}
[D] Mucho [Bm]te he amado en [Em]mi vida [A7]
[D] En tan [Bm]sublime oca[Em]sión te entre[A7]go mi corazón[D]
Porque en [Em]mi pecho se a[A7]nida [A7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro 2}
[D] Un a[Bm]mor que no se ol[Em]vida [A7]
[D] Cari[Bm]ño ni con la [Em]muerte [A7]
[D] Cómo [Bm]poder olvi[Em]darte [A7]
[D] Pues nun[Bm]ca aunque lo qui[Em]siera te quie[A7]ro aunque no me quie[D]ras
Yo na[Em]cí pa[A7]ra quererte [A7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Interludio}
[D]· · [Gm]·  · | [A7]·  · [Gm]·  · | [Dm]·  · [Gm]·  · | [A7]·  · [Gm]·  ·
[Dm]·  · [Gm]·  · | [A7]·  · [Gm]·  · | [Dm]·  · [Gm]·  · | [A7]·  · [Gm]·  ·
[Dm]·  · [Gm]·  · | [A7]·  · [Gm]·  ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 3}
[Dm] Oh qué [Bm]bello es el a[Em]mor [A7]
[D] Cuando [Bm]se quiere de ve[Em]ras, para [A7]mí la vida en[D]tera
Como en [Em]perfumada flor[A7]   [A7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro 3}
[D] Eres [Bm]mi único a[Em]mor [A7]
[D] Y he que[Bm]rido demos[Em]trarte [A7]
[D] Que yo [Bm]siempre he de a[Em]marte [A7]
[D] Porque [Bm]mi vida te [Em]llama y el [A7]corazón te re[D]clama
Yo na[Em]cí para querer[A7]te [A7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verso 4}
[D] Tu re[Bm]cuerdo me per[Em]sigue [A7]
[D] Por don[Bm]de quiera que [Em]voy, cuando a [A7]tu lado no es[D]toy,
Siento [Em]que mi alma se a[A7]flige [A7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro 4}
[D] Veo que tu[Bm] sombra me [Em]sigue [A7]
[D] A ve[Bm]ces quiero olvi[Em]darte [A7]
[D] No sé [Bm]si será mi [Em]suerte [A7]
[D] El no [Bm]poder olvidar[Em]te y esto [A7]será hasta el fi[D]nal
Yo na[Em]cí para querer[A7]te [A7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[D]↓
{end_of_verse}
